BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Lancaster Freethought Society
UID:event_315545892@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260718T032331Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260725T153000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260725T173000
SUMMARY:Saturday Freethought Conversations
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Freethought Society\n**July 25 Discussion: Living Ou
 r Values -**\n***How Do We Put Freedom\, Reason & Inquiry Into Action?***\
 n\nValues are not just words we agree with.\nThey become real through habi
 ts\, choices\, communities\, and action.\nLiving our values asks:\n**What 
 do we practice? What do we refuse? What do we build?**\n\n**Ground Rules**
 \n\n* Timed rounds\n* Up to 2 minutes each\n* Option to pass\n* No interru
 ptions\n* Brief open discussion after each round\n\n**Q1 — Personal Prac
 tice**\nWhere do freedom\, reason\, or inquiry show up in your daily life?
 \n\n**Q2 — Public Life**\nWhat should LFS stand for publicly?\n\n**Q3 
 — Refusal**\nWhat should freethinkers refuse to normalize?\n\n**Q4 — C
 ommunity**\nWhat kind of LFS community would you actually show up for?\n\n
 ***\n\n**Closing Question**\n**What is one action\, habit\, or commitment 
 you want to take forward?**\nChoose one: speak up\, listen better\, questi
 on assumptions\, build community\, support local action\, defend church/st
 ate separation\, practice evidence-based thinking.\n\n**Come curious. Come
  ready to listen.**
