SUMMARY:July Movie Night!  Tree of Life
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Freethought Society\nThis month\, we have as options
 :\n\nTree of Life\n-Trailer- https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RrAz1YLh8nY\n
 \nBaraka\n-Trailer- https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QcVmt5je88M\n\nMy Dinn
 er with Andre\n-Trailer- https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=n7hSY0QOkII&t=61s
 \n\nKoyaanisqatsi\n-Trailer- https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Gww3RkJ7uOU\n
 \nBattle of Algiers\n-Trailer- https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vhhoS3zOskE
 \n\nAnd many\, many more! Bring your own film selections and we may decide
  to show them!\n\nAdmission is Free! Bring as many family members and frie
 nds as you would like! Please RSVP! Discussion after the movie(s)\, hang o
 ut and share your thoughts!\n\nSome drinks and snacks will be provided\, p
 lease do bring more to share!\nPizza will be ordered\, please do chip in i
 f you partake in delivered food!\n\nSaturday\, July 25th\, 6:00pm - 10:00p
 m\nOther Room Theater\n715 N. Pine St.\nLancaster PA 17603\n\nWe can delay
  starting the movie to give people time to arrive\, but no later than 6:30
 pm\, please try to arrive before then if you do not want to miss any of th
 e movie.\n\nPICTURED below is the main entrance\, the event space is right
  up the stairs. On street parking should be available\, several public par
 king lots such as behind CVS are within a 2 blocks walk along Harrisburg P
 ike.
