SUMMARY:Patriarchy\, Matriarchy & Democracy: A Two-Part Online Discussion
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Freethought Society\nThis is an LFS online discussio
 n series\, held on Google Meet.\nAcross two sessions\, we’ll explore how
  patriarchy and matriarchy organize power\, care\, law\, family\, sex\, mo
 ney\, violence\, and democracy.\nWe’ll use consciousness-raising style d
 iscussion rules: speak personally\, listen carefully\, don’t interrupt\,
  and don’t debate someone while they are speaking.\nFor each question\, 
 we’ll do a speaking round first. After everyone who wants to speak has s
 poken\, Susan will offer brief evidence\, examples\, or definitions to dee
 pen the discussion.\n**Part 1**\n\n* What is patriarchy?\n* What is matria
 rchy?\n* How do these systems operate?\n\n**Part 2**\n\n* What are the ben
 efits of each?\n* What are the dangers or pitfalls of each?\n* Can democra
 cy exist inside a patriarchy?\n\nThis is not a lecture. It is a structured
  conversation about power\, equality\, family\, sex\, law\, care\, violenc
 e\, democracy\, and what kind of world we want to build.
